    "journey": {
      "type": "journey",
      "blocks": {
        "c1": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4F2451DB-A74E-4C00-A786-E206F2E4411E.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "harvest",
            "stage": "The harvest",
            "title": "Picked green, by hand.",
            "text": "<p>Cardamom grows in the shade of the forest canopy on the western slopes of the Ghats. Its pods do not ripen together, so each plant is picked over by hand, again and again through the season, taking only the pods that are full-sized and still green.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Season",
            "detail_value": "October – February"
          }
        },
        "c2": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_u6j6f1u6j6f1u6j6.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "sun",
            "stage": "The cure",
            "title": "Dried slowly, kept green.",
            "text": "<p>Freshly picked pods are heavy with moisture. They are cured slowly over gentle, steady heat — dry enough to keep, but slowly enough that the husk holds its green and the aromatic oil stays sealed inside the seed.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Aim",
            "detail_value": "Green husk, oil intact"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_dhynmadhynmadhyn.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "hand",
            "stage": "Sorting",
            "title": "Sorted by hand.",
            "text": "<p>Once cured, the pods are spread out and picked over. Split, pale, shrivelled and empty pods come out, along with stalks and dust, so that only sound, whole pods go on to be graded.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Taken out",
            "detail_value": "Splits, empties, stalks"
          }
        },
        "c4": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_e5vwx3e5vwx3e5vw.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "sieve",
            "stage": "Grading",
            "title": "Graded by sieve.",
            "text": "<p>Each lot is passed through graded meshes and divided by the hole a pod will pass through: 6 mm, 7 mm and 8 mm+. It is a measurement of size, not a verdict on flavour — which is why we will tell you when the smaller grade is the better buy.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Grades",
            "detail_value": "6 mm · 7 mm · 8 mm+"
          }
        },
        "c5": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_7rmdi07rmdi07rmd.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "aroma",
            "stage": "The nose test",
            "title": "Bought by aroma.",
            "text": "<p>A sieve says nothing about how much volatile oil is inside a pod. So before a price is agreed, we open pods and judge the seed itself: dark, slightly sticky and sharply fragrant. If the aroma isn't there, neither is the deal.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Before we buy",
            "detail_value": "Pods opened & smelled"
          }
        },
        "c6": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/A1213E5A-E27D-4C6E-B4BB-B2E6BF4BD5D4.png",
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "airtight",
            "stage": "Packing",
            "title": "Sealed whole, and dated.",
            "text": "<p>We never grind. Pods are packed whole into a light-proof tin — the husk is the best packaging cardamom has — and the label carries the harvest month and the date it was filled, so freshness is something you can check.</p>",
            "detail_key": "On every tin",
            "detail_value": "Harvest & fill dates"
          }
        },
        "c7": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "truck",
            "stage": "Dispatch",
            "title": "Filled the day it ships.",
            "text": "<p>We pack to order, not to stock. Your tin is filled, sealed and handed to the courier, so it spends its shelf life in your kitchen rather than in a warehouse.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Packed",
            "detail_value": "To order"
          }
        },
        "c8": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "image_alt": "",
            "icon": "cup",
            "stage": "Your kitchen",
            "title": "Crack it open.",
            "text": "<p>Bruise a pod with the flat of a knife and the cool, sweet lift arrives at once. Drop it whole into rice or chai, or grind the seed just before you need it. That moment is what the whole journey is for.</p>",
            "detail_key": "Keep it",
            "detail_value": "Whole, sealed, out of the light"
          }
        }
      },
